    "title": "Invincible season 4 episode 6 release time (by time zone), preview, and what to expect",
    "text": "In the previous episode of Invincible season 4, the war between the Viltrumites and the Coalition of Planets began. Sadly, it will go on without the help of Mark (Invincible), Nolan (Omni-Man), and Oliver (Kid Omni-Man).At the end of the episode, Invincible is gravely injured while killing Conquest. Mark knew that if he let up for even a second, Conquest would kill him, then return to Earth and kill everyone he loves. That's why he grabbed Conquest's throat and didn't let go until he was dead, even while Invincible's guts were falling out of his body.Thankfully, while the trio isn't in the fight now, they will eventually return to battle. Here's how you can watch the next episode to find out what's next.Invincible season 4 episode 6 release date and time on Prime VideoInvincible season 4 episode 6, titled \"You Look Horrible\", will premiere on Prime Video in the US on Wednesday, April 8, at 3:00 a.m. ET, 12:00 a.m. PT, 1:00 a.m. MT, and 2:00 a.m. CT. And while Prime Video tends to move the times of their shows, it's doubtful that Invincible will be moved.On that note, here are all of the global release times for the next episode of Invinicible season 4, including areas such as UK, Australia, India, and more:Hawaii: 9:00 p.m. HST on Tuesday, April 7Alaska: 11:00 p.m. AKDT on Tuesday, April 7West Coast of the US: 12:00 a.m. PT on Wednesday, April 8Mountain Time: 1:00 a.m. MT on Wednesday, April 8Midwest of the US: 2:00 a.m. CT on Wednesday, April 8East Coast of the US: 3:00 a.m. ET on Wednesday, April 8Brazil: 4:00 a.m. BRT on Wednesday, April 8UK: 8:00 a.m. GMT on Wednesday, April 8France: 9:00 a.m. CET on Wednesday, April 8Germany: 9:00 a.m. CET on Wednesday, April 8India: 12:30 p.m. IST on Wednesday, April 8Italy: 9:00 a.m. CET on Wednesday, April 8Spain: 9:00 a.m. CET on Wednesday, April 8South Korea: 4:00 p.m. KST on Wednesday, April 8Japan: 4:00 p.m. JST on Wednesday, April 8Sydney, Australia: 5:00 p.m. AEDT on Wednesday, April 8What to expect in Invincible season 4 episode 6There are two important parts of this story, and they're happening simultaneously. The first, and the more important when it comes to the safety of the universe, is the Viltrumite War. Allen the Alien and Zoe (Tech Jacket), along with the rest of the Coalition of Planets. Unfortunately, while Great Thaedus talks with the council, the Viltrumites attack Talescria thanks to the mole revealing their location.Meanwhile, Nolan and Oliver are protecting Mark while he heals from his life-threatening injuries. As Invincible recovers, Oliver and Nolan will bond. In the comics, it happened in a bunch of various panels over an extended period of time. In this episode, I fully expect these moments to be deeper and more heartwarming. And, after the anger Oliver had for his father, it will hit harder than the source material.Thanks for reading. Stay tuned to Bam Smack Pow's social media sites, Bluesky, Instagram, and Twitter for updates on Prime Video's hit show, Invincible, as they come out.This article was originally published on www.bamsmackpow.com as Invincible season 4 episode 6 release time (by time zone), preview, and what to expect.",
